# Sources:
# https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-profiles/#OWL_2_RL
# https://www.w3.org/2009/owl-test-cases
# Public OWL 2 RL named-class entailment fixture for the selected subset.
@prefix ex: <https://example.test/owl/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:Buyer a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Party .
ex:Party a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:Agent .
ex:Agent a owl:Class .
ex:Supplier a owl:Class ; owl:equivalentClass ex:Vendor .
ex:Vendor a owl:Class .
